        'Rover opening night',
        'Kickstarta Roverprogrammet med oss! På rovers alldeles egna invigning kommer ni får lära er mer om roverprogrammet, hur veckan kommer fungera, information om roverhubben och massa mer!',
        'Kickstart the Rover program with us! At Rover''s very own inauguration, you will learn more about the Rover program, how the week will work, information about the Rover Hub and much more!',
